Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.32,0:02:18.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.74,0:02:22.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.00,0:02:27.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.83,0:02:30.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Does your foot still hurt? {I'm going to assume you didn't revert the one about the ankle sprain because that was terrible}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.38,0:02:34.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. The pain's pretty much gone.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.84,0:02:36.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.76,0:02:46.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry I didn't respond to your text yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.18,0:02:49.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I passed out like a sack of potatoes when I got home.{happy?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.77,0:02:51.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, that's it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.77,0:02:58.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was terrified that you were mad at me or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.82,0:03:03.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You didn't do anything wrong, Yuuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.24,0:03:06.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I thought, maybe...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.87,0:03:12.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...you also liked Mabuchi-kun...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.08,0:03:14.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No way! Not a chance in hell!
