Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.17,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I did it again...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.01,0:03:22.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.43,0:03:29.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But there's no way I can take that back after seeing her this relieved...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.39,0:03:34.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No problem. I just have to make sure I don't fall for Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.40,0:03:38.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All those feelings I confused for love
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.23,0:03:40.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,were just a lapse in judgement.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.11,0:03:45.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,When a mean person acts nice for once, they suddenly look like angels.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.99,0:03:47.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.83,0:03:53.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of people out there just like him.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's not like... Kou's special or anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.21,0:04:02.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Not one bit!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.09,0:04:06.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, or are you just angry for no reason?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,N-N-No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.81,0:04:09.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you in class.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.73,0:04:21.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri, you're making your crush way too obvious.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.24,0:04:28.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if he noticed I was acting different.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.75,0:04:36.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I guess she really does love Kou now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri is radiant when she's in love. {keep phrasing, revert word. it ビビビと来た}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita-san, you like Mabuchi{-kun} now? {oops}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.81,0:04:59.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why are you two eating here?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.52,0:05:01.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. Let's have lunch together.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.86,0:05:03.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\blur4\an4\fsp3\bord0\shad0\fnKG June Bug\c&HFFFFFF&\fs38\b1\alpha&H80&\pos(406,230)}...Well, \N\h\hnot that I mind
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(777,0)\blur1\an4\fsp3\bord0\shad0\fnKG June Bug\c&H8B49E4&\fs38\b1\pos(406,230)}...Well, \N\h\hnot that I mind
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.78,0:05:11.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, Futaba-chan. You went to the same middle school as Mabuchi-kun, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.49,0:05:15.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? We did, but only for the first semester in our first year.{this is where "freshman year" would fit really nicely}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.96,0:05:20.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What was Mabuchi-kun like back then?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.46,0:05:24.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hmm, back in middle school...
