Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.85,0:05:29.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.89,0:05:31.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Really...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.14,0:05:34.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He was way shorter than he is now, and his voice was higher too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.43,0:05:38.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He was quiet and easy to get along with.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.48,0:05:41.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not a thing like he is now.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right now, Kou's more like...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.40,0:05:48.57,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,"I don't even try. Aren't I cool?"
