Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.57,0:05:51.62,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,It's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.62,0:05:52.66,AoHaru,,0,0,10,,Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.04,0:06:00.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then maybe I should {\i1}try{\i0} some things out on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was just kidding! That seriously hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.01,0:06:05.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where's your apology?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,F-Forgive me...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You two are so funny!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.47,0:06:16.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How was that funny? I'm dying over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have some sympathy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.02,0:06:21.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, I wouldn't do this to a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.27,0:06:24.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Only if they're girls, you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I won't lay a hand on Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.45,0:06:34.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You went too far.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.58,0:06:40.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'd never do something like that to a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.50,0:06:43.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} wouldn't.
