Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.67,0:06:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who are you to talk?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.84,0:06:50.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the guy who brought porn to the camp.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you saying in front of Murao?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't drag me into this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I even shared the porn with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.28,0:07:09.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, couldn't hold it in for two days?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.15,0:07:10.70,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Are you middle schoolers?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.30,0:07:31.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so unathletic.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.26,0:07:35.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.77,0:07:47.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun is so cool.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous of you, Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.53,0:07:55.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're close to Mabuchi-kun, \Nso you know all about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.24,0:07:56.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's his favorite food?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.79,0:08:02.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah, I wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.16,0:08:05.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then what about music? What's he into?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.13,0:08:08.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Dunno, I've never asked him.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you think he does on weekends?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't know that either...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.84,0:08:16.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then how about his favorite color?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.36,0:08:33.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know, I've actually been interested in him for a while now. {pretty cool hurts me, but only because it's a meme}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You have?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.74,0:08:40.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But I didn't realize that I liked him
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.91,0:08:44.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,until he helped me cross that river.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.46,0:08:47.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He's really nice,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.63,0:08:50.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and he makes my heart race,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.71,0:08:53.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but more than that, he's reliable.{congratulations on not doing the zeugma thing}{you made this sentence last time}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.17,0:08:54.13,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Super punch!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.84,0:08:59.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri really is cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.56,0:09:10.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All right, homeroom's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.23,0:09:12.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san, wanna come with?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.61,0:09:17.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.41,0:09:20.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, class reps.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.95,0:09:25.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You need to write up a report on the leadership course.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why just the class reps?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why {\i1}not {\i0}just the class reps? {where's muh witty retort?}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How lucky...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, I'll take care of it, so you can go...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.55,0:09:40.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.81,0:09:46.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave you to write it alone with a clear conscience.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.69,0:09:48.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There you go again.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.31,0:09:53.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Your words are honorable, but I know you just want to be alone with a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.57,0:09:55.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.99,0:10:00.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have fun, closet perv. See ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.74,0:10:02.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't hit me, stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.62,0:10:04.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.13,0:10:13.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'd stay and help if I didn't already have plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. Bye-bye, Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye-bye.{I know you always use "bye-bye" so what gives}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.39,0:10:23.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Mabuchi-kun, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure, see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.94,0:10:33.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.77,0:10:36.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll do this page. The girl can do the other one.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.82,0:10:38.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.42,0:10:54.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm getting butterflies in my stomach...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.38,0:10:58.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This feeling is new.{it's not necessarily umarete kara kinou made, just <longish period of time ago> kara kinou made}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs70\bord0\shad0\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strippedv2 H\b1\c&H575C5C&\pos(234.667,546.667)\frz135.5}Leadership Course Report
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs60\bord0\shad0\fnKozuka Mincho Pro Strippedv2 R\c&H575C5C&\frz136.6\pos(570.666,554.666)\b1}Class {\fnPenman\b0\fs70}2-2
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.35,0:11:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs70\bord0\shad0\fnPencilfiedX\c&H575C5C&\b1\frz135.8\pos(709.333,418.666)\2c&H0000FF&\2a&HFF&}Mabuchi Kou
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.26,0:11:07.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou's unexpectedly neat handwriting...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His thin fingers... {lit bony hands}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.77,0:11:11.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His shoulders...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.98,0:11:18.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,His eyes visible through the gaps in his bangs...{this one got really literal... but I think it sounds better this way anyway}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.45,0:11:26.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Every little thing makes me anxious...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This might be bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.17,0:11:36.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri likes him now!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get writing.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.02,0:12:32.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen your hand move in a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.27,0:12:33.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Give it here.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.69,0:12:36.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Completely blank!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.15,0:12:37.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll do it, I promise.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.65,0:12:40.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you volunteered to do the whole thing by yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.61,0:12:43.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Still working on it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.07,0:12:48.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll take a bit longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bring it to the faculty office when you're done.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.25,0:12:53.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.71,0:12:59.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't consider you a pervert, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.21,0:13:02.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.38,0:13:07.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Is there something on my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs40\bord1\shad0\3c&H32395B&\c&H32395B&\fnlaCartoonerie\frz342.2\fax-0.13\pos(710.667,388)}Pervy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.22,0:13:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs40\bord0\shad0\c&H32395B&\fnlaCartoonerie\frz342.2\fax-0.13\pos(710.667,388)}Pervy
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.01,0:13:11.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. There is.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That little...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.31,0:13:16.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Pervy!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Grab it for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.52,0:13:19.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.37,0:13:34.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.41,0:13:38.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just can't resist the back of his neck.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.88,0:13:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't sniff me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know you've been taking whiffs of me. {that's not what choi means. you'd know that if you watched hacha}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.43,0:13:50.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?! I haven't taken whiffs of anyone! Prove it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.68,0:13:51.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know you do!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.64,0:13:54.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Like back when I carried you during orienteering.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And the time you were rubbing my head in the lobby at the inn.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-I wouldn't say I sniffed you!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.98,0:14:02.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just happened to smell you...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.86,0:14:03.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No also! Those were the only times!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.65,0:14:09.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When we played cops and robbers.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.92,0:14:22.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He knew.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.38,0:14:28.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Even his payback is lame.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.22,0:14:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with this?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me your sheet.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It'll be faster if I do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.27,0:14:39.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He knew... he knew!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.52,0:14:41.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're telling me.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.36,0:14:46.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If I wasn't around, you'd be here all night.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.65,0:14:49.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What do I do...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.28,0:14:54.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is bad. Every time I think of Kou,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.04,0:14:58.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri's face comes to mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.92,0:15:04.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was just admiring the sky.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.30,0:15:18.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Aw, man. I wish I was a class rep.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.27,0:15:23.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan said she didn't like Mabuchi-kun,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.44,0:15:28.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but there's no telling what he thinks of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.28,0:15:30.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.62,0:15:37.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't get it off my mind!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.96,0:15:43.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Being in love is really uplifting,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.54,0:15:45.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but sometimes it brings you down, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.60,0:16:01.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We managed to finish up pretty early.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.90,0:16:11.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If I spend any more time with Kou alone...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.49,0:16:14.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.45,0:16:19.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can hand the report in by myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.66,0:16:22.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,This is definitely bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to turn back.
