Dialogue: 2,0:16:38.06,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur16\fs60\bord0\shad0\c&HE3E7F2&\fnFranklin Gothic Demi\1a&H7A&\p1\frz5.897\pos(794.666,473.334)\clip(m 434 278 l 438 332 762 272 752 217)}m -176 6 l -140 -22 -106 75 -84 -19 -64 -51 17 57 28 -38 45 -75 132 5 18 -38 -27 -66 -68 59 113 -81 213 2 120 -46 60 -94 -144 35
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.51,0:16:40.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Got it, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.56,0:16:42.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.03,0:17:00.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.21,0:17:13.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.13,0:17:16.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.56,0:17:24.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say to wait up while you were handing the report in?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.90,0:17:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I meant for you to go on home without me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.99,0:17:34.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.99,0:17:39.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But we take the same train, \Nso wouldn't that be kind of strange?{or "take the same train"}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.16,0:17:40.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.12,0:17:48.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.84,0:17:52.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.71,0:17:54.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll really fall in love.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.18,0:18:08.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, first that apology essay and now this report—all this writing is killing me. {fuckdamnshitcunts}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.53,0:18:17.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And the event planners get out of everything scot-free.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.79,0:18:26.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.17,0:18:38.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What should I do when I've fallen for the same boy my friend has?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.88,0:18:44.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If this is how it's going to feel, \NI'd rather forget all about Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.52,0:18:48.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But... I want to love.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But... but...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Our train's right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.33,0:19:12.71,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Please, just let somebody make the decision for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.46,0:19:17.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.09,0:19:21.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I think I forgot something.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.68,0:19:28.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If Kou doesn't get off the train, \Nthen I'll forget all about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.89,0:19:31.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, you forgot something?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.31,0:19:36.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he gets off, then I'll love him.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.44,0:19:37.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.40,0:19:44.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.41,0:19:51.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he stays, I'll forget. If he gets off, I'll love.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.71,0:19:53.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he stays, I'll forget.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.75,0:19:56.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he gets off, I'll love.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.42,0:19:58.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The doors will be closing momentarily.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.51,0:20:03.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,If he stays...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:11.89,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kudarizaka fumikiri made
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:11.89,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Before I knew it, I had run
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:16.90,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}atashi wa muchuu de hashitta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:16.90,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}all the way down to the train tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:22.57,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kono koi wo saegiru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:22.57,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}What I found was a train departing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:27.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}densha wa sugisatta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.57,0:20:27.45,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}taking my love with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:33.12,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}tooi hi no kioku  umi no kagayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:33.12,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Distant memories, shining seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:36.00,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}kisetsu wa meguru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:36.00,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Seasons pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:40.38,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:40.38,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Now, I squint up at the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:45.76,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:45.76,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:52.14,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}sayonara mo ienai mata
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:52.14,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.26,0:20:52.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So, did you leave it at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:21:01.99,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:21:01.99,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.48,0:20:53.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm such a liar. {I want to keep this, but I guess hypocrite would fit}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.23,0:21:02.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I never actually had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:07.53,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:07.53,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}If only the summer fireworks
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.82,0:21:04.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.41,0:21:08.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I didn't actually forget anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:13.46,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}namida no saki ni utsureba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:13.46,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}had appeared before my tears...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.33,0:21:09.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't go crazy on me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.79,0:21:17.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I pretended to hesitate, but I always knew the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:18.88,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will kitto omoidasu wa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.46,0:21:18.88,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}I will definitely remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.21,0:21:19.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:30.64,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:30.64,Ich werde,,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,200)}Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.38,0:21:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you feel okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And not only that...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.26,0:21:31.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I already knew that Kou would get off.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.43,0:21:36.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yuuri, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.78,0:21:43.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I also...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I also...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...love Kou.
